# Engine objects referencing a PLATFORM-defined symbol.
#
# EMPTY, and that is the point. Every host service the engine needs -- the
# arena, the output sink, the parallel-for, the worker set, the tablebase
# prober, the NUMA network replica -- arrives through an injection seam that the
# engine declares and the host registers before the first search.
#
# Keep it empty. The next host dependency added to engine/ fails this gate
# rather than joining a list.
